WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.027
AttestLock turns an Ethereum escrow receipt into a Creditcoin credit line.

00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:05.550
Collateral stays on Sepolia.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.292
Creditcoin acts only on a proof.

00:00:07.292 --> 00:00:13.223
This narrated overview shows previously completed testnet transactions, not an uninterrupted signing session.

00:00:13.223 --> 00:00:17.202
For lending and risk teams, collateral reporting is a critical trust boundary.

00:00:17.202 --> 00:00:21.742
AttestLock verifies a successful escrow receipt instead of accepting an operator's claim.

00:00:21.742 --> 00:00:25.721
It is a fixed-term origination reference, not a production liquidation system.

00:00:25.721 --> 00:00:27.328
The borrower locks mock USDC.

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:30.875
The worker waits for attestation and obtains the official proof.

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:33.313
Creditcoin's native BlockProver verifies it.

00:00:33.313 --> 00:00:38.799
The contract checks the exact vault, token, borrower, amount, remaining term, and both replay keys.

00:00:38.799 --> 00:00:41.736
Only then can a seven-day line open at fifty percent.

00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:43.158
Invalid paths stay closed.

00:00:43.158 --> 00:00:44.854
A junk transaction was refused.

00:00:44.854 --> 00:00:47.754
A tampered proof reverted while its query was unused.

00:00:47.754 --> 00:00:51.803
Replaying the valid query also reverted, with destination state unchanged.

00:00:51.803 --> 00:00:53.718
The worker never draws user credit.

00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:59.216
On September ninth, Chrome and Rabby completed approval, a hundred-token lock, and signed authorization.

00:00:59.216 --> 00:01:01.384
A page refresh recovered the waiting job.

00:01:01.384 --> 00:01:05.560
The native proof took two hundred eighty-nine thousand nine hundred eighty gas.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.525
Queue to execution, including attestation waiting, took about nine minutes.

00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:14.601
Two lines now record a hundred in opened credit; fifty borrowed, zero repaid, fifty outstanding.

00:01:14.601 --> 00:01:17.206
The earlier fifty-token draw was borrower-signed.

00:01:17.206 --> 00:01:20.609
Post-maturity repayment remains pending until September twelfth.

00:01:20.609 --> 00:01:21.992
Mock assets have no value.

00:01:21.992 --> 00:01:25.341
There is no interest, liquidation, or trustless source release.

00:01:25.341 --> 00:01:28.000
Open the public evidence and reproduce the checks.
